    {
      "title": "Netanyahu rival condemns ‘Jewish terrorism’ after settler attacks on Palestinian villages",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/netanyahu-rival-condemns-settler-arson-attacks-palestinian-villages-west-bank",
      "description": "<p>Dozens of militant Israeli settlers raided communities on Saturday night, setting fire to vehicles and several homes  </p><p>Arson attacks by militant Israeli settlers on Palestinian villages in the occupied West Bank have caused a political row in Israel, drawing condemnation from Gadi Eisenkot, the opposition leader, who described them as “Jewish terrorism”.</p><p>Dozens of settlers raided Palestinian communities overnight on Saturday, <a href=\"https://x.com/ShehabAgency/status/2124261726573261228?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E2124261726573261228%7Ctwgr%5E773daba416bdcaa45bff4400e7d5fd45c5370d48%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&amp;ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.timesofisrael.com%2Fpalestinian-homes-cars-set-ablaze-in-attacks-decried-by-eisenkot-as-jewish-terror%2F\">setting fire to about a dozen vehicles</a> and several homes and scrawling racist graffiti. At least four communities were attacked. Israeli police said they had launched an investigation with forensic teams.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/22/netanyahu-rival-condemns-settler-arson-attacks-palestinian-villages-west-bank\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-22T15:22:38"
    },
